      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would also be very useful to have frametime as well, as division in animators is somewhat awkward to do, it would be easier to have direct access to both values\n\nFrametime can be directly used in smoothing blend trees to do smoothing whereas with framerate you would have to first calculate 1 / framerate before you could use it",
